  "body": "Instead of having a \"scripting flag\" and then \"fixing\" scripts in createContextualFragment(), expand \"scripting flag\" to an enum (\"scripting mode\") which includes four modes:\n\n- disabled (noscript etc)\n- normal (main parser)\n- inert (usual fragment parser, setting already started etc)\n- immediate (what createContextualFragment does, marking scripts as non-parser-inserted).\n\nPass this mode around and refer to it in the correct places when processing the script tag.\n\nThis is in preparation of having a `runScripts` option in `setHTMLUnsafeOption`.\n\nThis change should modify any observable behavior, and is more in line with implementations (at least blink).\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12245/dynamic-markup-insertion.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 12, 2026, 10:58 AM UTC (27e18cb)\">/dynamic-markup-insertion.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12245/e161310...27e18cb/dynamic-markup-insertion.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 12, 2026, 10:58 AM UTC (27e18cb)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12245/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 12, 2026, 10:58 AM UTC (27e18cb)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12245/e161310...27e18cb/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 12, 2026, 10:58 AM UTC (27e18cb)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12245/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 12, 2026, 10:58 AM UTC (27e18cb)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/12245/e161310...27e18cb/parsin